OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with rape of
OL,4,A14-year-old boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with multiple
OL,7,Foffences, including the rape of a
OL,8,F14-year-old boy in Portsmouth,
OL,9,Faccording to police.
OL,11,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FConstabulary said it had charged Sadiq
OL,13,FFarhad Azad in connection with the
OL,14,Falleged rape of a teenager in an alley
OL,15,Foff London Road on 11 August.
OL,17,FThe force said the alleged incident had
OL,18,Ftaken place between 19:00 and 20:00 BST
OL,19,Fand involved a man not previously known
OL,20,Fto the child who they had spoken to on
OL,21,Fa bus.
