OL,5,
OL,6,FAzad, 33, has also been charged with
OL,7,Fallegedly stalking a woman in her 20s
OL,8,Fover the course of a year, and criminal
OL,9,Fdamage of a car belonging to a family
OL,10,Fmember of the alleged victim, police
OL,11,Fsaid.
